Bora is a Rust port of NeuralFoil and includes code and data derived from the
following MIT-licensed projects, whose license notices are reproduced below.

- NeuralFoil (https://github.com/peterdsharpe/NeuralFoil): the network
  architecture, input/output processing, and analysis model, and the network
  weights and input distribution in data/, which are converted from NeuralFoil's
  weight files.

- AeroSandbox (https://github.com/peterdsharpe/AeroSandbox): the Kulfan (CST)
  airfoil parameterization, coordinate generation, and parameter fitting.

The documentation site (docs/) bundles the B612, Michroma and Source Code Pro
typefaces under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; their license texts are
in docs/static/fonts/.

